      "content": "it just feels like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out. it's so exhausting to pretend that any of this is worth it when the math doesn't add up. if there's no meaning, then the struggle is just pointless suffering. sometimes i just think... if nothing matters, then maybe there's a kind of freedom in just stopping everything. like, if the universe doesn't care, why should i have to keep fighting it?",
